    "version": "4.0",
    "description": "合规规则引擎 v4：结构化时效 + 审核状态 + 例外 + 缺失处理；向后兼容 v3 的 condition 格式",
    "schema_notes": [
      "每条规则新增：rule_name/business_type/exceptions/missing_data_action/source_document_id/source_article/policy_validity{}/review_status/reviewer/last_reviewed/status",
      "condition 保持 v3 格式（AND 分组）；exceptions 为 OR 分组例外条件",
      "policy_validity 改为结构化对象；旧 policy_source/policy_validity 字段在消费时 fallback 读取",
      "review_status: verified（原文核对）/ draft（从摘要/推断）/ needs_review（TODO）/ deprecated",
      "status: active / expiring_soon（到期前6个月内）/ expired / superseded",
      "禁止编造规则：每条 verified 为 draft 或 needs_review 时，risk 提示必须标注'待核验'",
      "extension_hint: 新增规则照格式追加；优先引用已建档的 source_document_id（见 regulations/index.json）"
    ],
    "compatibility": "v3.0 所有字段保留为 fallback；v4 新字段优先消费"
  },
